              "text": "el título — \"the qualification, the title\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Es necesario el título de bachillerato. The secondary-school qualification is required."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "On a job notice el título is a qualification; on a book it is the title."
            }
          ]
        },
